# A land with "{T}: Add {W}" and "{T}: Add {R}" makes one mana that is white or red - never blue. Beside a Plains,
# Sunbillow Verge pays Lightning Helix's {R}{W}, but Consider's {U} is not offered to cast: the castability judgement
# matches each colored symbol to a source that can make that color (CR 106.1, 601.2g), not to "a mana of any color".

[Bot1 Deck]
Sunbillow Verge
Plains
Consider
Lightning Helix
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

